%S A402730 1,6,22,78,236,604,1466,3288,6742,13228,24672,43612,74720,123810,
%T A402730 198732,311860,478626,717968,1058556,1533108,2181124,3058624,4231912,
%U A402730 5767638,7783286,10362146,13675650,17819682,23081532,29488638,37557480,47205046,59192796
%N A402730 Expansion of g.f. Phi^5*F^3, where Phi = g.f. for A028930 and F = g.f. for A028959.
%C A402730 a(n) is the number of representations of n by the 16-variable quadratic form that is the sum of 5 copies of 2*x^2 + x*y + 3*y^2 and 3 copies of x^2 + x*y + 6*y^2.
%H A402730 Karan Sharma, <a href="/A402730/b402730.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..1000</a>
%H A402730 Bülent Köklüce, <a href="https://doi.org/10.1007/s11139-013-9480-4">Cusp forms in S_6(Gamma_0(23)), S_8(Gamma_0(23)) and the number of representations of numbers by some quadratic forms in 12 and 16 variables</a>, Ramanujan J. 34 (2014), 187-208. See p. 204.
%o A402730 (PARI) th(M, N) = 1 + 2*x*Ser(qfrep(M, N, 1), x);
%o A402730 a(n) = polcoef(th([4, 1; 1, 6], n+1)^5 * th([2, 1; 1, 12], n+1)^3, n);
%Y A402730 Cf. A028930, A028959, A328527, A328528, A328529, A328530, A328531, A328532, A328533, A328534, A328535, A328536, A401430, A401474, A402729.
